{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13602","headline":"迎春东郊 · 张濯","name":"迎春东郊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"颛顼时初谢，句芒令复陈。\n飞灰将应节，宾日已知春。\n考历明三统，迎祥受万人。\n衣冠宵执玉，坛墠晓清尘。\n肃穆来东道，回环拱北辰。\n仗前花待发，旗处柳疑新。\n云敛黄山际，冰开素滻滨。\n圣朝多庆赏，希爲荐沈沦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张濯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}